            <h4 class="sub_title_name">Sushma Puri</h4>
            <h5>Visionary Entrepreneur & Industry Trailblazer</h5>
            <div class="desc">
            A trailblazer with a global perspective, Sushma Puri was raised in Zambia and moved to London in 1977, where she built a career as a banker and investment manager before setting her sights on India in 1991. A visionary entrepreneur with an innate ability to identify and shape industry-defining ventures, she has been at the forefront of some of India's most transformative businesses.<br>
            She founded Magnum Nexus, elevating it into one of India's most sought-after event management agencies, renowned for curating extraordinary experiences. Her foresight led to the creation of TNE Systems, an innovative subscription- based online media planning platform that redefined industry standards. With Elite Model Management India, she revolutionized the modelling landscape, instilling unparalleled professionalism and ethics, and launching some of the most celebrated faces in fashion and film today. In 2019, she co-founded Nomad Pizza, bringing a fresh and inspired approach to India's growing cloud kitchen business thereby adding yet another successful venture to her list.<br>
            With a remarkable legacy of building and scaling pioneering businesses, Sushma Puri continues to shape industries with her keen strategic vision, deep- rooted industry relationships, and an unwavering commitment to excellence. Her name is synonymous with innovation, influence, and the power to turn bold ideas into lasting legacies.
          </div>
