            <h4 class="sub_title_name">Shweta Jain</h4>
            <h5>Architect of Luxury & Brand Transformation</h5>
            <div class="desc">
               With a distinguished career shaping South Asia's luxury lifestyle landscape, Shweta Jain has led transformative strategies across Spirits, Consumer Goods, Wellness, Media, and Communications. As Chief Business Development Officer at Diageo India, she played a pivotal role in driving premiumization and long-term growth in India & South Asia.<br>
                A visionary Commercial & Marketing leader, Shweta has spearheaded bold cultural initiatives, experiential innovations, and high-impact partnerships. Her achievements include building omnichannel experiences for Johnnie Walker, creating strategic alliances between Singleton and Nicobar, and the India launch of Don Julio, Monkey Shoulder, and Oral B. She played a key role in introducing the sustainability-forward luxury Single Malt, Godawan, and shaping the brand narratives of Gillette Vector, HT Mint, and Sprite.<br>
                Her global influence has earned her prestigious accolades, including 'Keeper of the Quaich 2022', 'Scotch Whisky Icon of the Year', and a spot in Black Book's Top Luxury Leaders in India.<br>
                Beyond the boardroom, Shweta actively mentors startups, founders, and management students, sharing her expertise across leading platforms and institutions.
            </div>
