            <h4 class="sub_title_name">Dr. Uktra Namshum</h4>
            <h5>The Art & Science of Timeless Beauty</h5>
            <div class="desc">
            With over 15 years of expertise in dermatology and aesthetic medicine, Dr. Uktra Namshum is a name synonymous with excellence in skin health. Her journey began at the prestigious Kempegowda Institute of Medical Sciences, Bangalore, where she earned her MBBS. She then refined her expertise with an MSc in Clinical Dermatology from Cardiff University, UK, followed by an elite Fellowship in Dermatologic Laser Surgery from Mahidol University, Bangkok, Thailand.<br>
Having worked with leading dermatology clinics across Delhi NCR, she honed her craft, mastering the fine balance between science and artistry in aesthetics. In 2022, she founded Hana Aesthetics, a sanctuary where cutting-edge technology meets personalized care.<br>
Dr. Namshum's philosophy is simple yet profound-beauty is harmony. Rather than treating isolated concerns, she believes in a holistic approach, ensuring every patient achieves a radiant, natural, and youthful appearance. With meticulously tailored treatments, she enhances skin health, bringing out the best version of you.   
            </div>
